This project builds on prior work, also MIT licensed:

  Tesla_BLE_TPMS — https://github.com/cunzulatu/Tesla_BLE_TPMS
  Copyright (c) 2026 cunzulatu

  The BLE payload offsets, the sleep-status threshold and the original
  empirical pressure and temperature formulas were established there. No code
  was copied; the protocol knowledge was.

  tpms_ble — https://github.com/bkbilly/tpms_ble
  Copyright (c) bkbilly

  The Home Assistant integration structure — passive coordinator wiring, the
  sensor platform layout and the battery discharge curve — follows this
  project's design.
